== Notes ==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* The area of effect is gargantuan; the spell description incorrectly lists it as colossal.
* Since the caster is (on some level) guiding the masses of flame to their targets (rather than inflaming an area; c.f. ''[[fireball]]''), this spell will only target creatures the caster can see.

